{"sheet": "full-finance-lost-rupee.pdf", "items": [{"id": "I1", "kind": "title", "text": "FULL CARD 29 — Probability, Expected Frequency and Finance", "page": 1, "section": "", "topic": "", "context": "", "marker": "", "bullet": false, "bold": ["FULL CARD 29 — Probability, Expected Frequency and Finance"]}, {"id": "I2", "kind": "title", "text": "MATHEMATICS • PROBABILITY • PERCENTAGES • FINANCIAL LITERACY", "page": 1, "section": "", "topic": "", "context": "", "marker": "", "bullet": false, "bold": []}, {"id": "I3", "kind": "point", "text": "For equally likely outcomes, P(event) = favourable outcomes ÷ total outcomes. Probabilities range from 0 to 1.", "page": 1, "section": "", "topic": "", "context": "PROBABILITY", "marker": "", "bullet": false, "bold": []}, {"id": "I4", "kind": "point", "text": "A bag contains 4 red, 3 blue and 1 green counter. One counter is selected at random.", "page": 1, "section": "", "topic": "", "context": "", "marker": "", "bullet": false, "bold": []}, {"id": "I5", "kind": "table", "text": "", "page": 1, "section": "", "topic": "", "context": "", "marker": "", "bullet": false, "bold": [], "table": {"kind": "grid", "header": ["Event", "Probability", "Decimal / percentage"], "rows": [["Red", "4/8 = 1/2", "0.5 = 50%"], ["Blue", "", "0.375 = 37.5%"], ["Green", "", "0.125 = 12.5%"], ["Not green", "", "0.875 = 87.5%"]]}}, {"id": "I6", "kind": "heading", "text": "Expected frequency", "page": 1, "section": "", "topic": "", "context": "", "marker": "", "bullet": false, "bold": ["Expected frequency"]}, {"id": "I7", "kind": "point", "text": "If the experiment is repeated 240 times, the expected number of green outcomes is 240 × 1/8 = 30. This is a long-run expectation, not a guarantee of exactly 30 green results.", "page": 1, "section": "", "topic": "", "context": "Expected frequency", "marker": "", "bullet": false, "bold": []}, {"id": "I8", "kind": "heading", "text": "Financial mathematics", "page": 1, "section": "", "topic": "", "context": "", "mar